  "Bluerock is described as a financial consultancy delivering data-driven strategies in planning and advisory, with a client-focused approach aimed at sustainable growth.": { sl: "Bluerock je opisan kot finančno svetovalno podjetje, ki zagotavlja na podatkih temelječe strategije pri načrtovanju in svetovanju s pristopom, osredotočenim na stranko, katerega cilj je trajnostna rast." },
