  "Customers can log in to manage property interest, review opportunities, follow their onboarding progress, and continue a purchase or participation journey through the portal.": { sl: "Stranke se lahko prijavijo za upravljanje zanimanja za nepremičnine, pregledovanje priložnosti, spremljanje njihovega napredka pri vkrcanju in nadaljevanje nakupa ali sodelovanja prek portala." },
  "Customers sign up, book a tour, and visit the apartment in person. This is our primary route for buyers seeking direct ownership in Batumi’s opportunity-driven market.": { sl: "Stranke se prijavijo, rezervirajo ogled in osebno obiščejo stanovanje. To je naša glavna pot za kupce, ki iščejo neposredno lastništvo na trgu Batumi, ki ga vodijo priložnosti." },
  "Customers sign up, book a tour, and visit the apartment in person. This route is designed for buyers seeking direct ownership and exposure to Batumi’s long-term growth story.": { sl: "Stranke se prijavijo, rezervirajo ogled in osebno obiščejo stanovanje. Ta pot je zasnovana za kupce, ki iščejo neposredno lastništvo in izpostavljenost dolgoročni zgodbi o rasti Batumi." },
  "Customers sign up, review selected apartments, book a private tour, and move through reservation and purchase with the AIXCO team.": { sl: "Stranke se prijavijo, pregledajo izbrane apartmaje, rezervirajo zasebno turnejo in se pomaknejo skozi rezervacijo in nakup z ekipo AIXCO." },
  "Customers sign up, review selected Batumi apartments, book a private tour, and move through reservation and purchase with the AIXCO team.": { sl: "Stranke se prijavijo, pregledajo izbrane apartmaje Batumi, rezervirajo zasebni ogled in se pomaknejo skozi rezervacijo in nakup z ekipo AIXCO." },
