  "For 60% financing a traditional credit check is not required. Higher financing amounts may require standard bank credit approval and income verification.": { sl: "Za financiranje 60% tradicionalno preverjanje kreditne sposobnosti ni potrebno. Višji zneski financiranja lahko zahtevajo standardno bančno odobritev kredita in preverjanje dohodka." },
  "For clients buying apartments or reserving units in Batumi through a guided digital process.": { sl: "Za stranke, ki kupujejo stanovanja ali rezervirajo enote v Batumi prek vodenega digitalnega procesa." },
