  "For developers seeking placement, distribution, and buyer market access.": { sl: "Za razvijalce, ki iščejo umestitev, distribucijo in dostop do trga za kupce." },
  "For developers seeking project visibility, buyer access, tour coordination, and a stronger real estate sales channel.": { sl: "Za razvijalce, ki iščejo prepoznavnost projekta, dostop kupcev, koordinacijo potovanj in močnejši kanal za prodajo nepremičnin." },
  "For intermediaries and distribution partners introducing clients and managing deal flow.": { sl: "Za posrednike in distribucijske partnerje, ki predstavljajo stranke in upravljajo tok posla." },
  "For intermediaries managing clients, tours, and deal flow.": { sl: "Za posrednike, ki upravljajo stranke, oglede in posel." },
  "For many clients, this leads to direct ownership of carefully selected properties in emerging, profitable, sustainable markets.": { sl: "Za mnoge stranke to vodi do neposrednega lastništva skrbno izbranih nepremičnin na nastajajočih, donosnih in trajnostnih trgih." },
  "For others, AIXCO offers an alternative participation program for clients who would like exposure to the market without the commitments that come with owning and managing property themselves.": { sl: "Za druge AIXCO ponuja alternativni program sodelovanja za stranke, ki bi se želele izpostaviti trgu brez obveznosti, ki jih prinaša lastništvo in upravljanje lastnine." },
  "For owners who want AIXCO support after purchase with handover, rental coordination, documents, and reporting.": { sl: "Za lastnike, ki želijo podporo AIXCO po nakupu s predajo, usklajevanjem najema, dokumenti in poročanjem." },
