  "From property ownership and strategic partnership to professional asset management, AIXCO is with you at every stage of the journey.": { sl: "Od lastništva nepremičnin in strateškega partnerstva do profesionalnega upravljanja premoženja, AIXCO je z vami na vseh stopnjah potovanja." },
