  "20+ years of experience in digital banking and fintech. Grew a bank's customer base from 5 million to 12.7 million. Held several senior leadership positions across the banking sector. Specialises in AI and digital transformation, building ecosystems that serve millions of customers.": { sl: "20+ let izkušenj na področju digitalnega bančništva in fintecha. Povečal je bazo strank banke s 5 na 12.7 milijona. Zasedal je več vodilnih položajev v bančnem sektorju. Specializiran je za umetno inteligenco in digitalno preobrazbo ter ustvarja ekosisteme za milijone strank." },
