  "Since 2009, AIXCO has bought, sold, and brokered real estate across Europe and the Gulf - today focused on Batumi, with a legacy track record in Switzerland and Dubai.": { sl: "Odkar je 2009, AIXCO kupoval, prodajal in posredoval pri nepremičninah po vsej Evropi in Zalivu – danes se osredotoča na Batumi, z zapuščeno zgodovino v Švici in Dubai." },
  "Since 2009, AIXCO has bought, sold, and brokered real estate across Europe and the Gulf - today focused on selected emerging-market opportunities, with a legacy track record in Switzerland and Dubai.": { sl: "Odkar je 2009, AIXCO kupoval, prodajal in posredoval pri nepremičninah po vsej Evropi in Zalivu – danes se osredotoča na izbrane priložnosti na nastajajočih trgih, z zapuščeno zgodovino v Švici in Dubai." },
  "Since 2009, AIXCO has bought, sold, and brokered real estate across Europe and the Gulf—today focused on Batumi, with a legacy track record in Switzerland and Dubai.": { sl: "Odkar je 2009, AIXCO kupoval, prodajal in posredoval pri nepremičninah po Evropi in Zalivu – danes se osredotoča na Batumi, z zapuščino v Švici in Dubai." },
  "Since 2009, AIXCO has bought, sold, and brokered real estate across Europe and the Gulf—today focused on selected emerging-market opportunities, with a legacy track record in Switzerland and Dubai.": { sl: "Odkar je 2009, AIXCO kupoval, prodajal in posredoval pri nepremičninah po vsej Evropi in Zalivu – danes se osredotoča na izbrane priložnosti na nastajajočih trgih, z zapuščeno zgodovino v Švici in Dubai." },
  "Since its first acquisition in 2009, the company has grown through carefully selected real estate decisions, building a portfolio defined by resilience, stability, and recurring income generation.": { sl: "Od svojega prvega prevzema v 2009, je podjetje raslo s skrbno izbranimi nepremičninskimi odločitvami, gradilo je portfelj, ki ga opredeljujejo odpornost, stabilnost in ponavljajoče se ustvarjanje dohodka." },
  "Since its first acquisition in 2009, the company has steadily expanded within the Swiss residential real estate market, developing a portfolio defined by resilience, stability, and recurring income generation.": { sl: "Od prvega prevzema v 2009, se je podjetje vztrajno širilo na švicarskem trgu stanovanjskih nepremičnin in razvijalo portfelj, ki ga opredeljujejo odpornost, stabilnost in ponavljajoče se ustvarjanje dohodka." },
